     57  1013							; M or SPACE changed: muteNow = mute xor momentary. The SID goes to volume 0;
     58  1013							; the Game Boy and NES get note-offs (so nothing hangs on, and their tails
     59  1013							; ring out naturally), and their notes come back when it unmutes.
